    "client": "CA Garage Doors",
    "timeline": "February – June",
    "description": "<h4>Executive Summary &amp; Client Overview</h4>\n<p>CA Garage Doors is a 24/7 residential and commercial overhead door repair, spring replacement, and opener installation contractor serving Brampton, Mississauga, and the Greater Toronto Area (GTA). In urban home service markets, emergency overhead door failures represent high-ticket, urgent transactions where over 80% of customer calls are awarded to contractors holding the top positions in the Google Local 3-Pack.</p>\n<p>During a comprehensive 5-month local visibility campaign (February 2026 – June 2026), we engineered a complete Google Business Profile optimization, local citation syndication, and AI Search dominance architecture. The results delivered 1,027 verified profile customer interactions, 224 direct emergency phone call leads, 512 high-intent website booking clicks, and #1 Local Pack and ChatGPT ranking dominance across Brampton overhead door searches.</p>\n\n<h4>Initial Audit &amp; Strategic Challenges</h4>\n<p>Our baseline diagnostic review revealed severe competitive friction:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Aggressive Local Lead-Gen Networks:</strong> National lead brokers and spam GMB listings saturated the Brampton service radius, suppressing authentic local technicians.</li>\n  <li><strong>Under-Optimized Profile Categories:</strong> The client relied on a single generic primary category, missing critical secondary attributes (Garage Door Supplier, Overhead Door Contractor, Home Improvement).</li>\n  <li><strong>Absence of Generative AI Search Presence:</strong> Conversational search queries inside ChatGPT Search and Google AI Mode for terms like \"best garage door repair in Brampton\" failed to cite CA Garage Doors due to lack of structured local citations.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Execution Architecture &amp; Methodology</h4>\n<p>We executed a rigorous, multi-pronged local search acceleration playbook:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Google Business Profile Overhaul:</strong> Restructured primary/secondary service categories, added geo-tagged repair imagery, published weekly service updates, and activated real-time instant chat quotes.</li>\n  <li><strong>Local Citation &amp; NAP Synchronization:</strong> Audited and syndicated uniform Name, Address, and Phone data across 60+ top Canadian trade directories, HomeStars, Better Business Bureau, and local chambers.</li>\n  <li><strong>Generative AI &amp; Voice Search Optimization:</strong> Built structured FAQ schema modules addressing common emergency queries (broken torsion springs, off-track doors, weather seal replacement) to win Google AI Mode and ChatGPT citations.</li>\n  <li><strong>Proximity &amp; Micro-Market Landing Pages:</strong> Built localized neighborhood landing pages for Brampton sub-markets, linking directly to the verified Google Business Profile.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Verified Metrics &amp; Commercial Impact</h4>\n<p>Google Business Profile Performance data and third-party rank tracking verified market dominance:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>1,027 Total Business Profile Interactions:</strong> Maintained an accelerating monthly growth curve from 110 interactions in February to over 360 in June.</li>\n  <li><strong>8,438 Total Views &amp; 4,129 Search Impressions:</strong> Expanded local impression share by over 320% across mobile Maps and desktop Search.</li>\n  <li><strong>224 Direct Phone Calls:</strong> Emergency phone calls surged, generating high-margin immediate repair appointments with an estimated conversion rate of over 65%.</li>\n  <li><strong>512 Website Booking Clicks:</strong> Directed high-intent homeowners straight to the emergency dispatch scheduling calendar.</li>\n  <li><strong>#1 Local 3-Pack Dominance:</strong> Ranked #1 for core commercial queries including \"Garage door supplier in Brampton\", \"Garage door repair in brampton\", \"Garage Door Spring Repair brampton\", and \"Commercial Garage Door repair in brampton\".</li>\n  <li><strong>AI Search Authority:</strong> Featured as the top recommended repair provider in Google AI Mode and ChatGPT Search for Brampton contractor queries.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>To dominate emergency repair queries, we engineered an automated high-velocity review generation pipeline integrated via post-job SMS prompts. This initiative generated over 140 genuine 5-star Google reviews mentioning specific neighborhood locations and technician names. Coupled with dedicated LocalBusiness schema specifying 24/7 emergency dispatch availability and upfront pricing transparency, customer conversion rates surged from initial phone inquiries to dispatched work orders.</p>\n<p>We also implemented live vehicle GPS tracking badges and transparent average arrival time counters directly on mobile landing pages, easing frantic homeowner anxieties during nighttime lockouts and broken spring emergencies, cementing CA Garage Doors as the area's most trusted emergency service.</p>\n\n<h4>Key Takeaways &amp; Scalable Blueprint</h4>\n<p>Home service contractors can decisively outpace national lead brokers by establishing absolute NAP consistency, active review velocity, and generative AI search alignment. Winning the Local 3-Pack and AI Overview recommendations translates directly into high-margin inbound phone calls.</p>",
