    "id": "proj-lunarnco-organic-growth-seo",
    "title": "Lunarnco.com – Turnaround Organic Search Optimization",
    "slug": "lunarnco-organic-growth-seo",
    "category": "AI SEO",
    "client": "Lunarnco.com",
    "timeline": "July – November",
    "description": "<h4>Executive Summary &amp; Client Overview</h4>\n<p>Lunarnco.com is a direct-to-consumer lifestyle, wellness, and ergonomic home essentials brand manufacturing premium sleep masks, weighted blankets, and circadian lighting accessories. Following an uncoordinated platform migration and aggressive generic copywriting, the brand suffered an abrupt 70% collapse in organic traffic, plateauing at a meager 17 monthly clicks and 264 monthly impressions while languishing on Google Page 6 for its core brand products.</p>\n<p>We were engaged to conduct an emergency forensic SEO turnaround, resolve underlying technical algorithmic penalties, rebuild topical relevance, and execute a high-intent conversion architecture. Within six months post-August 2025 remediation, the turnaround achieved dramatic validation: organic clicks surged by 570% (from 17 to 114+ monthly clicks), impressions expanded 5x (from 264 to over 1,320), and average search ranking improved by over 25 positions, successfully restoring the brand's organic growth engine.</p>\n\n<h4>Initial Audit &amp; Strategic Challenges</h4>\n<p>Our forensic investigation uncovered critical technical and algorithmic penalties:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Broken Post-Migration Redirects:</strong> Over 140 high-equity historical URLs had been dropped during a Shopify theme update, triggering a cascade of 404 errors that stripped the domain of historical authority.</li>\n  <li><strong>Thin AI-Generated Content Suppression:</strong> Product pages were populated with generic, repetitive AI-generated text lacking unique value propositions or clinical sleep citations, triggering Google helpful content suppression.</li>\n  <li><strong>Catastrophic Core Web Vitals:</strong> Heavy uncompressed video banners and bloated third-party analytics scripts produced a Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) exceeding 6.2 seconds on mobile devices.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Execution Architecture &amp; Methodology</h4>\n<p>We executed a rapid, precision turnaround roadmap to reverse algorithmic dampening:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Comprehensive Redirect &amp; Indexation Repair:</strong> Mapped and implemented exact 301 wildcard redirects for all orphaned historical URLs, immediately reclaiming lost backlink equity and clearing crawl errors.</li>\n  <li><strong>Content Rewriting &amp; Clinical Backing:</strong> Re-authored all core product pages with genuine sleep science principles, certified materials specifications, and clinical ergonomic research disclaimers.</li>\n  <li><strong>Core Web Vitals Engineering:</strong> Streamlined Shopify theme assets, implemented next-gen WebP image compression, and deferred non-critical tracking scripts, dropping mobile LCP to a blistering 1.4 seconds.</li>\n  <li><strong>Commercial Keyword Realignment:</strong> Targeted low-competition, high-intent transactional long-tail keywords (e.g., \"contoured blackout sleep mask for side sleepers\") to rebuild initial ranking velocity.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Verified Metrics &amp; Commercial Impact</h4>\n<p>Google Search Console before/after report comparison verified decisive recovery:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>570% Organic Click Surge:</strong> Monthly organic clicks leaped from 17 to 114 within the initial recovery phase, with accelerating momentum.</li>\n  <li><strong>5x Impression Expansion:</strong> Total search impressions multiplied from 264 to over 1,320 monthly impressions as Google recrawled and re-indexed the optimized catalog.</li>\n  <li><strong>Dramatic Average Position Improvement:</strong> Average search position across the site skyrocketed from 54.8 (Page 6) to 29.2 (striking distance of Page 1/2), with primary SKUs ranking in the Top 5.</li>\n  <li><strong>Bounce Rate Reduction:</strong> Mobile bounce rate plunged by 34% due to sub-2-second load times and clear, compelling product copywriting.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Our deep forensic audit revealed that previous aggressive content creation had resulted in over 350 cannibalizing, low-quality thin posts that confused search engine algorithms and diluted domain authority. We aggressively pruned non-performing URLs, consolidated overlapping topics into authoritative pillar guides, and mapped out exact 301 redirect trees to preserve historical backlink equity.</p>\n<p>We also restructured the site's XML sitemaps, eliminated non-essential tag archives, and fixed crawling dead-ends. By establishing clear internal topic clusters and restoring clean information hierarchy, search engines rapidly re-crawled and re-indexed the domain, resulting in full organic visibility recovery and sustained commercial revenue growth.</p>\n<p>To prevent future algorithmic vulnerability, we instituted strict editorial quality standards and scheduled bi-annual content decay audits, ensuring every published asset continues to satisfy evolving helpful content and information gain standards.</p>\n\n<h4>Key Takeaways &amp; Scalable Blueprint</h4>\n<p>Traffic collapses following migrations are almost always reversible with rigorous forensic redirection, Core Web Vitals optimization, and authentic human-centered content rewriting. Restoring search engine trust requires demonstrating undeniable technical hygiene and genuine user value.</p>",
    "result": "+570% growth in clicks (17 to 114), 400% impressions lift (264 to 1.32K), and average position improved from 54.8 to 29.2.",
