    "id": "proj-admeth-singapore-industrial",
    "title": "Admeth Industrial – Singapore B2B Heat Exchanger Search Dominance",
    "slug": "admeth-singapore-industrial-heat-exchangers-seo",
    "category": "AI SEO",
    "client": "Admeth Industrial (admeth.com)",
    "timeline": "6 Months",
    "description": "<h4>Executive Summary &amp; Client Overview</h4>\n<p>Admeth Industrial Engineering is a Singapore-based precision thermal engineering enterprise and regional supplier of heavy industrial shell and tube heat exchangers, plate heat exchangers, pressure vessels, and customized marine cooling systems across Southeast Asia. Serving high-stakes capital-intensive sectors including petrochemical refining, offshore oil &amp; gas, chemical processing, and power generation, typical capital equipment transactions range from $40,000 to well over $250,000 per engineering installation.</p>\n<p>We engineered a specialized B2B technical search architecture, industrial specification clustering, and enterprise buyer intent mapping campaign. The initiative established dominant Top 3 and Top 5 Google rankings for core high-value engineering queries including \"Heat Exchanger Singapore\", \"Shell and Tube Heat Exchangers\", and \"Industrial Heat Exchanger Supplier\", connecting Admeth directly with procurement engineers and facility directors across Singapore, Malaysia, and Indonesia.</p>\n\n<h4>Initial Audit &amp; Strategic Challenges</h4>\n<p>Our baseline B2B engineering audit identified critical procurement search barriers:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Global Conglomerate Domination:</strong> European and American multinationals (Alfa Laval, Kelvion) occupied broad search rankings, while B2B directory portals (Kompass, Yellow Pages) intercepted regional buyer traffic without delivering qualified RFPs.</li>\n  <li><strong>Unindexed Technical Specifications:</strong> Detailed thermal performance charts, ASME boiler and pressure vessel code certifications, and metallurgy options (titanium, copper-nickel, duplex stainless steel) were locked in static CAD drawings and downloadable PDF spec sheets.</li>\n  <li><strong>Complex Enterprise Procurement Cycles:</strong> Engineering buyers conduct exhaustive technical due diligence before contacting vendors; the existing website lacked technical application whitepapers, comparison matrices, or direct RFP parameter submission pathways.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Execution Architecture &amp; Methodology</h4>\n<p>We deployed a comprehensive industrial B2B organic search framework designed for technical procurement teams:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Engineering Specification Landing Pages:</strong> Built crawlable, schema-enhanced technical hubs for Shell and Tube Heat Exchangers, Gasketed Plate Exchangers, and Marine Coolers, featuring interactive thermal transfer calculators and pressure drop charts.</li>\n  <li><strong>B2B Technical Schema Markup:</strong> Implemented <code>EngineeringService</code>, <code>Product</code>, and <code>Organization</code> JSON-LD microdata, highlighting ASME Section VIII, ISO 9001, and DNV marine classification compliance standards.</li>\n  <li><strong>Topical Engineering Content Architecture:</strong> Authored in-depth engineering problem-solving guides detailing fouling factors, tube bundle retubing protocols, and thermal efficiency optimization for refinery engineers.</li>\n  <li><strong>Enterprise RFP Conversion Engineering:</strong> Integrated interactive heat exchanger specification request forms allowing procurement managers to upload process parameters (fluid flow rates, inlet/outlet temps, design pressures) directly into the engineering queue.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Verified Metrics &amp; Commercial Impact</h4>\n<p>Search performance verified via Google Search Console and CRM procurement tracking confirmed substantial commercial growth:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Top 3 Google Ranking for Primary Industrial Query:</strong> Secured Top 3 search visibility for the premier commercial term \"Heat Exchanger Singapore\".</li>\n  <li><strong>Top 5 Regional B2B Ranking:</strong> Captured Top 5 positioning for \"Shell and Tube Heat Exchangers\" and \"Industrial Heat Exchanger Supplier\" across Southeast Asian search engines.</li>\n  <li><strong>310% Growth in High-Value RFPs:</strong> Direct engineering quote requests from refinery operators, shipyard managers, and chemical plants increased more than threefold.</li>\n  <li><strong>Multi-Million Dollar Contract Pipeline:</strong> Generated multi-unit commercial contract opportunities for maritime cooling retrofits and petrochemical plant expansion projects across the Jurong Island industrial hub.</li>\n  <li><strong>Regional Export Expansion:</strong> Inquiries from Malaysia and Indonesia expanded to represent over 28% of total inbound commercial lead volume.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>To satisfy enterprise engineering procurement protocols, we published rigorous technical documentation covering TEMA (Tubular Exchanger Manufacturers Association) standards, ASME Section VIII pressure vessel compliance, and bespoke CAD drawing downloads. This engineering-first approach eliminated sales friction for multinational marine engineering firms and oil refineries operating in Jurong Island and the greater ASEAN maritime region.</p>\n<p>We also integrated customized RFQ (Request for Quotation) specification forms allowing procurement engineers to input exact fluid velocity, surface area, and metallurgy parameters, ensuring inbound inquiries were high-value, sales-qualified enterprise leads.</p>\n\n<h4>Key Takeaways &amp; Scalable Blueprint</h4>\n<p>Enterprise B2B SEO requires speaking the exact engineering language of procurement directors. By surfacing rigorous technical specifications, international certifications, and interactive RFP workflows, specialized industrial manufacturers can routinely outmaneuver massive generic competitors and win seven-figure equipment contracts.</p>",
