    "timeline": "6 Months",
    "description": "<h4>Executive Summary &amp; Client Overview</h4>\n<p>Ubiz Floral &amp; Decor is a premier international e-commerce retailer and direct importer specializing in luxury wedding candelabras, crystal tabletop centerpieces, faux botanical installations, and event venue styling equipment serving event planners, wedding venues, and hospitality design directors across the United States and global markets. In the luxury wedding and event design sector, planners make high-value purchasing decisions based on visual grandeur, precise spatial sizing, and immediate product availability.</p>\n<p>We designed and executed a multi-channel visual e-commerce SEO, Answer Engine Optimization (AEO), and high-intent buyer clustering campaign. The initiative captured dominant Top 3 and Top 5 Google rankings for core commercial queries including \"Wedding Candelabras Centerpieces\" and \"Best Artificial Plants and Grass\", while winning the exclusive #1 Google AI Overview and featured snippet answer for the critical conversational sizing query \"What Candelabra Size Works Best for Wedding Tables\".</p>\n\n<h4>Initial Audit &amp; Strategic Challenges</h4>\n<p>Our diagnostic e-commerce audit highlighted key operational and search bottlenecks:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Displacement by Rental Houses and Social Platforms:</strong> Image-heavy platforms (Pinterest, Instagram) and local party rental directories intercepted prospective buyers, obscuring direct purchasing and wholesale ownership options.</li>\n  <li><strong>Unanswered Conversational Decision Queries:</strong> Event planners frequently search for practical dimension guides (e.g., table diameters vs centerpiece heights to prevent blocking guest sightlines), queries that the site previously ignored.</li>\n  <li><strong>Image Asset Under-Optimization:</strong> Thousands of breathtaking wedding photography assets lacked structured schema, descriptive alt-tags, and modern next-gen formatting, leaving Google Image Search completely untapped.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Execution Architecture &amp; Methodology</h4>\n<p>We deployed a sophisticated visual e-commerce and conversational AEO framework:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Conversational Sizing AEO Hubs:</strong> Engineered detailed spatial design guides detailing centerpiece heights, guest eye-level clearance, and floral foam mechanics, structured with Q&amp;A schema for generative AI extraction.</li>\n  <li><strong>High-Resolution Visual Image SEO:</strong> Converted all catalog imagery to next-gen WebP formats with semantic, keyword-rich file naming and comprehensive <code>ImageObject</code> microdata.</li>\n  <li><strong>Product &amp; Merchant Center Integration:</strong> Implemented advanced <code>Product</code>, <code>AggregateRating</code>, and <code>Offer</code> JSON-LD, unlocking Google Merchant badges and price-drop alerts.</li>\n  <li><strong>Event Planner B2B Volume Pricing Tiers:</strong> Developed dedicated wholesale trade program landing pages targeting banquet halls, florists, and professional event producers with tiered trade discounts.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Verified Metrics &amp; Commercial Impact</h4>\n<p>Performance verified through Google Search Console, Google Analytics 4, and Shopify checkout reporting:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Top 3 Google Ranking for Core Product Terms:</strong> Secured Top 3 search visibility for the high-yield commercial keyword \"Wedding Candelabras Centerpieces\".</li>\n  <li><strong>#1 Google AI Overview &amp; Featured Answer:</strong> Won the #1 featured answer box and AI Overview citation for \"What Candelabra Size Works Best for Wedding Tables\".</li>\n  <li><strong>Top 5 Commercial Position for Decor Queries:</strong> Captured Top 5 rankings for \"Best Artificial Plants and Grass\" and \"commercial faux floral installations\".</li>\n  <li><strong>385% Increase in Bulk Candelabra Orders:</strong> Wholesale wedding venue and event planner multi-piece orders surged, driving substantial growth in gross merchandise volume.</li>\n  <li><strong>Global Shipping Expansion:</strong> International orders from Europe, Canada, and Australia grew to represent 22% of total digital sales.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>To capture lucrative B2B commercial event planners alongside retail brides, we launched dedicated trade accounts offering bulk wholesale tier pricing and commercial flame-retardant certifications on all artificial floral installations. We also published definitive centerpiece height-to-table sightline calculation tables, ensuring event planners could design picture-perfect wedding receptions without obstructing guest sightlines.</p>\n<p>Furthermore, our team optimized high-resolution visual lookbooks with Pinterest-integrated rich product pins and descriptive alt attributes, attracting wedding planners and venue coordinators directly from visual search platforms into high-ticket decor orders.</p>\n\n<h4>Key Takeaways &amp; Scalable Blueprint</h4>\n<p>Visual and wedding e-commerce brands must combine aesthetic excellence with pragmatic conversational Answer Engine Optimization. By directly answering planning dilemmas such as table sizing and clearance, brands establish authoritative trust that seamlessly converts research into checkout transactions.</p>",
